    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isandīko mu sī ya Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti aho baalīdima ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu, būlyīnja ī Ebenezeeli, būlītwala Ashidodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu būlītūūla mu hekalu ya ng'wa Dagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Ashidodi aho baamisha ī dilū, būmonela hasī ū Dagoni, wagwaaga abundaalile ū kū būtongi walyo ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA! Būmūūcha ū Dagoni, būng'wīmīīlīcha hangī a h'ipandī lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho baamisha hangī ī dilū ya lūshikū lwa ntondo yaho, būmonela hasī hangī ū Dagoni, wagwaaga abundaalile ū kū būtongi walyo ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA, ū ntwe gwakwe gwabbudīkaga, pye na a makono gakwe; shūgwa hasī a ha nyango henaho, gūūlekeelwa dūhū ū mīlī gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene kūshisha lelo a bagabīji ba ng'wa Dagoni na a banhū a bangī abo bakingīlaga ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Dagoni ī Ashidodi, batapandaga a ha mbaawa ja ha nyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gūkabadidohela no a bana Ashidodi na a magūngūli ayo gaalī gīpīndije; ū SEEBA ūbenhela būkenaagūji būtaale no, ūbagwisīja makoye ga mabaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū ba Ashidodi aho babona īlīja gīko ī mihayo, būhaya; “Yaya ū kwikala ng'wenūmu ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, nguno ū nkono gwakwe gwatūbuna no a bise benekīlī nū Mulungu wise ū Dagoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būbitana pye a basugi ba Bafilisiti būbabūūja, “Tūlyīte kinehe ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Baisilaeli?” Banhū būhaya, “Līsaamījagi Gaasi ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Baisilaeli.” Ng'hana būlīsaamīja Gaasi ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho baalīsaamīja koi, ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gūūbalemeela nabo a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo; būzwangana na kazwanganīle kangī nako nīyo. Ūbatūla a banhū ba nzengo gwenūyo, bataale na bado būyūgulumūkīlwa mabaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlyīnja nū kwene ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA būlītwala Ekuloni. A bana Ekuloni būyoganya balīhaya, “Batwenhela kūūnū ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, kwiza kūtūmala na a banhū bise!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū bikobya pye a basugi ba Bafilisiti; būhaya, “Lyīnjagi ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Baisilaeli; līlekagi līje ūko līkikalaga, ūlū ītī chene līkūtūmala pye na a banhū bise.” Nguno ī licha līkabazwanja a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakapūlūgūka ū kūcha būyūgulumūkīlwa mabaale; ū kūlīla kwa banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo kūshika ng'wigūlū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
